WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.708
- [Narrator:] This fall…

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.125
watch one man

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.375
attempt the impossible.

00:00:05.916 --> 00:00:06.916
- [Together:] BOOOO.

00:00:07.125 --> 00:00:09.250
- Running backs aren’t an optimal position anymore!

00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:11.625
- I'm going to break the rushing record, record.

00:00:11.875 --> 00:00:14.625
- But you'll have one more game than Eric Dickerson. It'll have an asterisk!

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.500
- MY WHOLE CAREER’S HAD AN ASTERISK.

00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:21.750
- Derrick Henry can never be a professional running back.
He’s far too big and strong!

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:22.500
- AHHHH!

00:00:23.125 --> 00:00:27.750
- Derrick, stop stiff-arming. You’re scaring the other children at the University of Alabama.

00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:29.750
- [Narrator:] Watch him buck the projections.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:33.000
- Look, we come from a long line of Oilers. That’s all we’ll ever be.

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:36.916
So just hide the fact that you’re 6'3", 240 pounds and be a normal back.

00:00:37.166 --> 00:00:39.500
- [Narrator:] And inspire us...
Wait, wh—what’s this?

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:43.375
- It’s a tweet from Adam Schefter.
Titans RB Derrick Henry suffered a potentially season-ending—

00:00:43.375 --> 00:00:45.000
- Oh, no. Oh, OK, Derrick’s hurt.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.000
OH, NO, WHAT THE HELL? DERRICK'S BASICALLY THE WHOLE TEAM.

00:00:48.125 --> 00:00:48.791
- What are you doing?

00:00:48.791 --> 00:00:51.500
- I’M SORRY. I’M TRYING TO STIFF-ARM LIKE DERRICK, BUT IT’S HARD.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.416
- Rapoport also has it. Now it’s real.

00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:54.916
- Sorry, family only.

00:00:55.375 --> 00:00:57.291
- Can't you see? I'm his brother.

00:00:57.416 --> 00:00:59.375
- Oh, no, no. No, I’m not.
- He’s very clearly not.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:01.875
- [Narrator:] OK, uh, the story of...of Ryan.

00:01:01.875 --> 00:01:03.250
- IF YOU WANNA WIN SO BAD, WIN.

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.458
- I’M GONNA TRY TO WIN.

00:01:04.458 --> 00:01:06.500
- GOOD, WE ARE IN TOTAL AGREEMENT.

00:01:06.791 --> 00:01:08.291
- You watching Derrick’s high school tape?

00:01:08.416 --> 00:01:11.166
- No…this was Derrick playing this year’s Buffalo Bills.

00:01:11.291 --> 00:01:12.291
- [Narrator:] Critics are calling it…

00:01:20.666 --> 00:01:21.708
With Saquon Barkley.

00:01:21.833 --> 00:01:23.541
- You wanna know what the best part of my day is?

00:01:24.166 --> 00:01:26.541
Driving up to the Giants facility and hoping no one is there.

00:01:26.916 --> 00:01:27.958
- [Narrator:] Najee Harris.

00:01:28.208 --> 00:01:30.291
- [Loudspeaker:] Najee, we’re tripling your production.

00:01:30.791 --> 00:01:31.791
- But I'm just a rookie!

00:01:32.041 --> 00:01:34.166
- [Narrator:] Whoever’s playing running back for the Ravens.

00:01:34.791 --> 00:01:36.666
And introducing Cordarrelle Patterson...

00:01:36.791 --> 00:01:38.916
- I’M A RECEIVER. BACKS GET USED AND ABUSED.

00:01:39.291 --> 00:01:40.791
- [Narrator:] And Cordarrelle Patterson.

00:01:41.166 --> 00:01:43.416
- I’M A RUNNING BACK. WE CAN PLAY INTO OUR 30s NOW.

00:01:43.666 --> 00:01:46.708
- [Narrator:] Watch Tannehill...become a Tanne-MOUNTAIN.

00:01:46.791 --> 00:01:49.416
- They say he could only be out for, like, six weeks!

00:01:49.625 --> 00:01:50.583
WOOOOH!
♪♪♪

00:01:52.291 --> 00:01:53.958
- [Narrator:] Gridiron Heights presents...

00:01:54.708 --> 00:01:58.125
Remember the Titan...Out now and out indefinitely.

00:01:58.541 --> 00:02:00.458
- Any other division we'd be done, so thank God for you guys.

00:02:00.666 --> 00:02:03.666
- Oh, ya, totally.
- Ya, you got this man.
- My lawyer's advised me not to say anything.

00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:08.958
- And from the makers of Remember the Titan…

00:02:09.583 --> 00:02:13.958
Comes the story of the rag-tag Cleveland Browns in...

00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:18.916
- Sorry, it’s just me. We’re all taking turns being hurt.

